    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etaa Esta enkaiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi kuna baa, ina kata pee eyagaa engoro o laiguanani Serser, nedamu Fashiti ina nataasa o ina naidipaki aatejo enkaraki ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki isinkan lo laiguanani ooisiaita ninye, “Nchoo meing'orakini olaiguanani ntoyie sidain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negelu olaiguanani ilaitasheikinok too loshon pooki le nkitoria enye, pee eiturrurru ntoyie pooki sidain meshomo enkaji oo nkituaak te Susa te ina ang kitok netoni ti abori enkirrita e Hegai ilo sunash ogelema lo laiguanani laa ninye olaing'urani loo nkituaak; nchoo meishori ninche iila enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entito naitiship olaiguanani nchoo eaku ninye enkitok enye te rishata e Fashiti.” Neitiship ina olaiguanani, neiko neijia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa Olyahudi otii Susa ina ang kitok oji enkarna enye Mordekai, olayioni le Yair, olayioni le Shimei olayioni le Kish Olbenchamini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.10+2KI.24.11+2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 24.10-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " otarayioki apa te Yerusalem te nebo lelo ootarayioki te nebo Yekonia olaiguanani le Yuda, otaarayie Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitubulu Hadasa, aa taa Esta, entito o lenkapu lenye amu meeta apa menye aashu ng'otonye. Entito apa ninye sidai naa supat, ore ake pee eye menye o ng'otonye, neya Mordekai netiu anaa enkerai enye keon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eibulaa enkitanapata o laiguanani, neiturrurri ntoyie kumok te Susa te ina aji naitasheiki Hegai, neyae sii ninye Esta atua enkaji o laiguanani nepiki abori enkirrita e Hegai laa ninye olaing'urani loo nkituaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitiship ina tito ninye nenyorru ninye neisho ninye asioki ntokitin naakusore, o eoroti enye e ndaa, o sinkan naapishana gelunot naaing'ua enkaji o laiguanani, neisho ninye o nena sinkan enyena ewueji sidai te nkaji oo nkituaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu ninye elimu Esta iltung'ana lenye o lorere lenye amu eitanapa Mordekai pee melimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore nkolong'i pooki nelo Mordekai te dukuya ina aji oo nkituaak pee eiyiolou Esta eneikununo, tenaa keserian.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elotu enkata pee elo ake pooki tito enetii Serser, te siadi ilapaitin tomon ti abori nkitanapat oo nkituaak, aa taa ena apa enkata enye naisikarrare, ilapaitin ile te ilata o manemane, o lapaitin ile loo sonkoyoni naarropil oo nkituaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elo entito atua ine netii olaiguanani tena oitoi, neishori pooki toki naba anaa enayieu neya eing'uaa enkaji oo nkituaak o meshomo enkaji o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elo ninye teipa, ore tadekenya neshukunye alo olgilata li are te nkaji e Sha-ashgas ilo apa sunash ogelema lo laiguanani oing'or nkapiak; eitu eitoki alo enetii olaiguanani, meteleku te netishipe olaiguanani te ninye naa keipoti te nkarna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ebau erishata e Esta entito e Abihail nkapu e Mordekai, oowa apa ninye aitaa entito enye, pee elo atua ine netii olaiguanani, eitu eikilikuanu toki meteleku ake ina natiaaka Hegai, ilo sunash ogelema lo laiguanani laa ninye oitasheiki nkituaak. Neitiship Esta nkonyek e lelo pooki ootodua ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eyae Esta enetii olaiguanani Serser, ti atua enkaji enye e nkitoo to lapa le tomon, laa ninye olapa le Tebes to lari li opishana le nkitoria enye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenyorru olaiguanani Esta aitalang nkituaak pooki, neitiship Esta nkonyek enyena alang nkulie toyie pooki, neaku etipika emaupe e nkitoria endukuya enye nepik ninye erishata e Fashiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani aisho osiriua sapuk ilkituaak lenyena pooki o sinkan; osirua le Esta. Neitoki sii aishoru empalakinoto e kodi too lkerenketi neishori nkishorot te risioroto e nkarsisisho e nkitoria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitajeuo Mordekai enkishui o laiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eitokini aiturrur nena toyie eniare, etonita Mordekai te nkishomi o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitu elimu Esta olmarei lenye arashu iltung'ana lenye, anaa enaitanapa Mordekai; amu kening apa Esta Mordekai ebaiki apa pee eitubulu ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore nena olong'i, anaa enatonita Mordekai te kishomi o laiguanani, negoro oare le lelo sunaishi oogelema lo laiguanani Bigsan o Teres neing'oru eneiko pee epik nkaik enye olaiguanani Serser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyiolou Mordekai ina bae, neliki ninye Esta enkitok o laiguanani, neliki Esta olaiguanani te nkarna e Mordekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ejurruni ina bae nenyorrikini aajo neijia etiu, neilili lelo tung'ana pokira oare te nchumata olchani. Neigeri nena baa te mbuku oo nkatitin te dukuya olaiguanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
